---
import Container from '@components/ui/Container.astro';
import Eyebrow from '@components/ui/Eyebrow.astro';
---

<section class="section">
  <Container>
    <Eyebrow>Planning your visit</Eyebrow>
    <h2>Best Time to Surf in Tamarindo for Beginners</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">
      Short answer: any time of year works for beginners in Tamarindo. Here's the longer
      answer.
    </p>

    <div class="season-grid">
      <div class="season-card season-dry">
        <h3>Dry Season</h3>
        <div class="season-months">December – April</div>
        <p>
          The most popular window for a reason. Sunny skies, minimal rain, mellow-to-medium
          swell, and predictable morning conditions. Water is clear, sunsets are big, and the
          town is lively. If it's your first surf trip, this is the easiest window.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="season-card season-green">
        <h3>Green Season</h3>
        <div class="season-months">May – November</div>
        <p>
          Bigger swell and afternoon rain showers. Mornings are still surfable and often less
          crowded. Some of our best lessons happen in September and October when the water is
          warmest and the beach feels almost private. Sunny mornings, quick tropical showers,
          not all-day downpours.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tip-box">
      <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">☀️</div>
      <div>
        <strong>Best time of day, any season</strong>
        <p>
          Book a lesson between 7 and 10 AM. Wind is offshore or glassy, the sun isn't
          scorching yet, and you have your whole afternoon free.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>

<style>
  .section { padding: var(--section-pad) 0; }
  .section-intro {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
  }
  .season-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .season-card {
    padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    color: var(--white);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .season-dry {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--sunset) 0%, #FBBF24 100%);
  }
  .season-green {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--teal) 0%, #059669 100%);
  }
  .season-card h3 { color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 0.375rem; }
  .season-months {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }
  .season-card p { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95); margin: 0; }
  .tip-box {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--bg-alt);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--sunset);
  }
  .tip-box .icon { font-size: 1.5rem; flex-shrink: 0; line-height: 1.2; }
  .tip-box strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 0.375rem; }
  .tip-box p { margin: 0; color: var(--text); }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .season-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
